# Never let the scraper's working files reach this repo. The parent directory
# holds live session cookies, a personal CV and the jobs database; only the
# generated page belongs here.
*.db
*.pdf
*.log
.linkedin_session.json
.vercel

# Live store credentials, pulled here by `vercel install`. Broader than the
# `.env*.local` the CLI writes, because a plain `.env` holds the same secrets
# and this repository is public.
.env*
